(Katee Sackhoff:)All right, now a little tongue.

8
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,030
GEORGE TAKEI:
Hold on there.

9
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:29,200
(George Takei:)We've only just rekindled
the romance.

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:34,310
(George Takei:)Let's not sully the moment
with the exchange of saliva.

11
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,310
(Katee Sackhoff:)Don't listen to him.

12
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:37,780
(Katee Sackhoff:)She wants it.

13
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:38,840
(Katee Sackhoff:)Tongue.

14
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,050
La, la, la, la, la.

15
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,050
(Penny:)See?

16
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,690
(Katee Sackhoff:)Now make the move.

17
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,720
(George Takei:)Mm-mmm.
Too soon.

18
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,520
(Katee Sackhoff:)Trust me, she's ready.

19
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:52,890
(Howard:)Make the move.

20
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:53,990
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)No, no, no.

21
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:57,030
(George Takei:)A lady wants to be wooed,

22
00:00:57,030 --> 00:01:00,600
(George Takei:)courted slowly.

